<title>SPAIN: Citibank sets warrants over five Spanish stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants over five Spanish stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Espana said on Monday is issuing American-style call and put warrants over five Spanish stocks.</p>
<p>The statement added Citibank is offering 500,000 warrants each over Acerinox, BBV, Banco Santander, FCC and Iberdrola.</p>
<p>Issue data is March 18 1997, while payment data is March 20 1997. Expiry date is September 18 1998. These warrants will expire without automatic exercise. They must be sold or exercised prior to this date.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
